// The B07 boss arena as a standalone scenario (WP-075, `BossArena-v0`): Castellan's Hall and
// Castellan Voss. docs/game/05-enemies-and-bosses.md, "B07 Castellan Voss, the Overfit Warden".
// It copies the castle level's hall (data/levels/castle/layout.ron), shifted so the hall runs
// x in [-22, 22], z in [0, 42] on a floor at y = 0 (the level's z minus 342).
//   - The player spawns at (0, 0, -8) facing +Z, in the antechamber (x in [-4, 4], z in [-12, 0]).
//   - The fog gate is the plane z = -2, 8 m wide, opening into the hall (+Z). Walls close the
//     antechamber and the rest of the hall's south side.
//   - Voss waits mid-hall at (0, 0, 22), facing the gate (-Z).
//   - Two rows of three pillars stand at x = +-14 (z = 10, 22, 34). The hall is otherwise open:
//     the player can circle on either side of him, and the chandeliers (phase 2) fall anywhere.
(
  spawn: (0.0, 0.0, -8.0),
  spawn_yaw: 0.0,
  kill_y: -12.0,
  heightfield: None,
  boxes: [
    (name: "floor", center: (0.0, -0.5, 16.0), half_extents: (23.0, 0.5, 28.0)),
    (name: "wall_west", center: (-23.0, 5.0, 21.0), half_extents: (1.0, 5.0, 22.0)),
    (name: "wall_east", center: (23.0, 5.0, 21.0), half_extents: (1.0, 5.0, 22.0)),
